W5-M19 maintained distribution integration.

This package is a thin consumer of current SameDayDesk interfaces already
on SDS PR52:

- tools/presence (surface dry-run / protected-field apply gate)
- tools/presence/registry-consumer.mjs (latest vs unfiltered MCP Registry)
- server/paid-useful-jobs (PR52 wrapper CLI, not a second runner)
- client/public/for-agents/useful-jobs/catalog.json
- client/public/discovery/useful-jobs.json

It does not copy those kernels, does not vendor another MCP registry client,
and does not rewrite the homepage or root package.json.

